{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26137","headline":"及第谣 · 周匡物","name":"及第谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水国寒消春日长，燕莺催促花枝忙。\n风吹金榜落凡世，三十三人名字香。\n遥望龙墀新得意，九天勅下多狂醉。\n骅骝一百三十蹄，踏破蓬莱五云地。\n物经千载出尘埃，从此便爲天下瑞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周匡物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}